If you're a fan of South Park, you're already bought it.
tl;dr game was good, but there's too much another bad things that make it bad.
+ story and gameplay
This part have issues, people in other reviews can say more. Game somewhat worse than Stick of Truth overall, but it's good enough to say this game is good and I wanted to keep playing it until it's done. I'm not much of an impression guy, so I can't discribe my emotions, but "it was fun";
- price
Man, after finishing the game, if you still thinking if you spent too much money on it, it's a concern;
- uplay
I don't care as much about garbage software, but it's still a bad practice and must be discouraged;
- denuvo
Game was cracked the next day! Denuvo known for causing problems in games, and use of problematic DRM must be discouraged;
~ (upd.) day 1 DLC
it's visual stuff. Nothing that could extend your gaming experience.

